<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
    .header { background: #1976d2; color: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #fafafa; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .record-number { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; }
    th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; }
    th { background: #f2f2f2; width: 35%; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px;">Zapisnik na odobrenje – SIM Tracker</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Poštovani,</p>
      <p>Novi zapisnik o ugradnji <span class="record-number">{{recordNumber}}</span> čeka na vaše odobrenje.</p>
      <h3>Podaci zapisnika</h3>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Broj zapisnika</th><td>{{recordNumber}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Brojilo</th><td>{{meterSerialNumber}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>EPBIH IP</th><td>{{ipAddress}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Adresa</th><td>{{installationAddress}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Grad / Općina</th><td>{{municipality}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Instalirao</th><td>{{installedByName}}</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p><a href="{{appUrl}}/installation-records/{{recordId}}" style="color: #1976d2;">Otvorite zapisnik u aplikaciji</a></p>
      <p>Srdačan pozdrav,<br>SIM Tracker</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
